t">Humaines</div><div class="v" id="kH">0</div><small class="muted">Intention utilisateur, sécurité, lisibilité, éthique</small></div></div><div class="sep"></div><div class="grid2"><div><label>Barèmes (0–100) — ajustables</label><div class="row"><div><small>F (fonctionnelles)</small><input id="wF" type="range" min="0" max="100" value="25"><div class="mini" id="wFv"></div></div><div><small>C (cognitives)</small><input id="wC" type="range" min="0" max="100" value="25"><div class="mini" id="wCv"></div></div><div><small>S (systémiques)</small><input id="wS" type="range" min="0" max="100" value="25"><div class="mini" id="wSv"></div></div><div><small>H (humaines)</small><input id="wH" type="range" min="0" max="100" value="25"><div class="mini" id="wHv"></div></div></div><small class="muted">Le score global Q est une moyenne pondérée (barèmes normalisés).</small></div><div><label>Checklist Qualités (évaluation locale)</label><textarea id="qcChecklist" placeholder="F: commandes exactes, chemins, idempotence, tests.\nC: hypothèses explicites, étapes, limites.\nS: dépendances, risques, rollback, observabilité.\nH: sécurité, non-ambigu, respect préférences."></textarea><div class="row"><button id="btnSaveQC">Sauver checklist</button><button id="btnQCFromOutput">Analyser sortie</button><button id="btnQCSnapshot">Snapshot (Vault)</button></div></div></div><div class="grid2"><div><label>Détails (F/C/S/H)</label><div class="log" id="qcDetail"></div></div><div><label>Historique Qualités</label><div class="log" id="qcHistory"></div></div></div></div><div id="tab_rules" class="tabPane" style="display:none"><div class="grid2"><div><label>Règles (gauche) – checklist</label><textarea id="rulesText" placeholder="1) Entrée claire ? 2) Données ? 3) Risque ? 4) Plan ? 5) Validation ?"></textarea><div class="row"><button id="btnEvalRules">Évaluer (local)</button><button id="btnSaveRules">Sauver</button></div></div><div><label>Directives (droit) – style/synthèse</label><textarea id="styleText" placeholder="Concis, opérationnel, FR. Sortie: étapes + commandes + chemins exacts."></textarea><div class="row"><button id="btnSaveStyle">Sauver</button><button id="btnAddPattern">Ajouter patterns</button><button id="btnClearPatterns">Vider patterns</button></div><textarea id="patternAdd" placeholder="Un pattern par ligne."></textarea><div class="log" id="patternsLog"></div></div></div></div><div id="tab_goals" class="tabPane" style="display:none"><div class="grid2"><div><label>Objectifs actifs</label><div class="row"><input id="goalText" placeholder="Objectif (ex: corriger USDC SPL)"><button id="btnSaveGoal">Ajouter</button><button id="btnCloseGoal">Clore dernier</button></div><div class="log" id="goalsLog"></div></div><div><label>Historique</label><div class="log" id="historyLog"></div></div></div></div><div id="tab_vault" class="tabPane" style="display:none"><div class="grid2"><div><label>Ajouter item (local)</label><div class="row"><input id="vTitle" placeholder="Titre"><input id="vTags" placeholder="tags: solana,nginx,bot"></div><div class="row"><select id="vType"><option value="note">note</option><option value="var">var</option><option value="code">code</option><option value="json">json</option><option value="url">url</option><option value="qc">qc</option></select><input id="vValue" placeholder="Valeur (url) si type=url"></div><textarea id="vCode" placeholder="Contenu…"></textarea><div class="row"><button id="btnVaultAdd">Ajouter</button><button id="btnVaultClear">Vider</button></div></div><div><label>Vault local</label><div class="row"><input id="vFilter" placeholder="filtre (mot/tag)"><button id="btnVaultRefresh">Refresh</button></div><div class="log tall" id="vaultLog"></div></div></div></div><div id="tab_neuroneone" class="tabPane" style="display:none"><div class="grid2"><div><label>NEURONEONE (localStorage)</label><div class="row"><input id="nKey" placeholder="clé NEURONEONE" value="NEURONE_DB_v1"><button id="btnNLoad">Charger</button><button id="btnNProbe">Probe</button></div><small class="muted">Lit la base NEURONEONE si elle existe (vars/apps/snippets). Import/export vers le Vault local.</small><div class="log" id="nLog"></div></div><div><label>Actions NEURONEONE</label><div class="row"><input id="nPick" placeholder="index à importer (ex: 1)"><button id="btnNImportOne">Importer 1→Vault</button></div><div class="row"><button id="btnNImportAll">Importer ALL→Vault</button><button id="btnNPushVaultItem">Pousser dernier Vault→NEURONEONE</button></div><div class="row"><button id="btnNSaveBack">Sauver NEURONEONE</button><button id="btnNClear">Vider NEURONEONE</button></div><small class="muted">Le format NEURONEONE est conservé au mieux (fallback si structure inconnue).</small></div></div></div><div id="tab_structureone" class="tabPane" style="display:none"><div class="grid2"><div><label>STRUCTUREONE (graphe)</label><div class="row"><input id="sKey" placeholder="clé STRUCTUREONE" value="STRUCTUREONE_DB_v1"><button id="btnSLoad">Charger</button><button id="btnSProbe">Probe</button></div><small class="muted">StructureOne = noeuds + liens. Sert à modéliser: objectifs→modules→actions→tests→risques.</small><div class="log" id="sLog"></div></div><div><label>Édition rapide</label><div class="row"><input id="sNodeName" placeholder="Nom noeud"><input id="sNodeTags" placeholder="tags: goal,tool,risk,test"></div><div class="row"><button id="btnSAddNode">Ajouter noeud</button><input id="sFrom" placeholder="from id"><input id="sTo" placeholder="to id"><button id="btnSLink">Lier</button></div><div class="row"><button id="btnSSyncFromMem">Sync depuis MEM</button><button id="btnSSave">Sauver</button><button id="btnSClear">Vider</button></div><small class="muted">Sync MEM: crée des noeuds pour objectifs/patterns et un noeud Qualités(Q) lié.</small></div></div><div class="grid2"><div><label>Vue noeuds</label><div class="log" id="sNodes"></div></div><div><label>Vue liens</label><div class="log" id="sLinks"></div></div></div></div></div></section></main><input type="file" id="fileImport" accept="application/json" style="display:none"><script>(()=>{const $=id=>document.getElementById(id);const LSKEY="CERVEAU_PP_V1";const now=()=>new Date().toISOString();const S={armed:false,lastOut:"",mem:{cfg:{llmUrl:"",llmAuth:"",llmFormat:"openai",llmModel:""},rules:"",style:"",goals:[],patterns:[],history:[],vault:[],qc:{w:{F:25,C:25,S:25,H:25},checklist:"",hist:[]},neuroneone:{key:"NEURONE_DB_v1",raw:null,items:[],dirty:false},structureone:{key:"STRUCTUREONE_DB_v1",g:{nodes:[],links:[]},dirty:false}}};const setP=(el,t,cls)=>{el.textContent=t;el.className="pill"+(cls?(" "+cls):"")};const log=(t,k="info")=>{const m=`[${now()}] ${k.toUpperCase()}: ${t}\n`;$("eventLog").textContent=m+$("eventLog").textContent};const save=()=>localStorage.setItem(LSKEY,JSON.stringify(S.mem));const load=()=>{try{const x=localStorage.getItem(LSKEY);if(x){const o=JSON.parse(x);if(o&&typeof o==="object")S.mem=Object.assign(S.mem,o)}}catch(e){};apply();renderAll();diag(true)};const apply=()=>{$("llmUrl").value=S.mem.cfg.llmUrl||"";$("llmAuth").value=S.mem.cfg.llmAuth||"";$("llmFormat").value=S.mem.cfg.llmFormat||"openai";$("llmModel").value=S.mem.cfg.llmModel||"";$("rulesText").value=S.mem.rules||"";$("styleText").value=S.mem.style||"";$("patternAdd").value="";$("qcChecklist").value=S.mem.qc.checklist||"";$("wF").value=String(S.mem.qc.w.F??25);$("wC").value=String(S.mem.qc.w.C??25);$("wS").value=String(S.mem.qc.w.S??25);$("wH").value=String(S.mem.qc.w.H??25);$("nKey").value=S.mem.neuroneone.key||"NEURONE_DB_v1";$("sKey").value=S.mem.structureone.key||"STRUCTUREONE_DB_v1";wRender();};const wRender=()=>{$("wFv").textContent=`${$("wF").value}`;$("wCv").textContent=`${$("wC").value}`;$("wSv").textContent=`${$("wS").value}`;$("wHv").textContent=`${$("wH").value}`;};["wF","wC","wS","wH"].forEach(id=>$(id).oninput=()=>wRender());const diag=(silent)=>{const d=[];try{const k="__t";localStorage.setItem(k,"1");localStorage.removeItem(k);d.push(["localStorage",true])}catch(e){d.push(["localStorage",false])}d.push(["fetch",!!window.fetch]);d.push(["LLM_URL",!!(($("llmUrl").value||"").trim())]);const ok=d.filter(x=>x[1]).length;setP($("qcPill"),`Q:${scoreGlobal().toFixed(1)}`,ok===d.length?"ok":"warn");if(!silent)log("Diagnostic: "+d.map(x=>`${x[0]}=${x[1]?"OK":"NO"}`).join(" | "),ok===d.length?"ok":"warn");return d};const llmCfg=()=>({url:($("llmUrl").value||"").trim(),auth:($("llmAuth").value||"").trim(),fmt:$("llmFormat").value,model:($("llmModel").value||"").trim()});const llmHeaders=c=>{const h={"Content-Type":"application/json"};if(c.auth)h.Authorization=c.auth;return h};const llmCall=async(mode,input)=>{const c=llmCfg();if(!c.url)throw new Error("LLM_URL_EMPTY");const sys=`Tu es le module ${mode.toUpperCase()} du cerveau. Contraintes: (1) pas de fiction (2) opérationnel (3) si info manque: demander précisément (4) respecter préférences: pas de blabla, résultat concret (5) proposer rollback/verify si script/batch.`;const add=`\n\n[DIRECTIVES]\n${(S.mem.style||"").trim()||"(aucune)"}\n\n[PATTERNS]\n${(S.mem.patterns||[]).slice(0,20).join("\n")||"(aucun)"}\n\n[REGLES]\n${(S.mem.rules||"").trim()||"(aucune)"}`;const payload=(c.fmt==="openai")?{model:c.model||"default",messages:[{role:"system",content:sys},{role:"user",content:(input||"")+add}]}:{prompt:`[MODE=${mode}]\n${sys}\n\n${input}\n${add}`,mode};const r=await fetch(c.url,{method:"POST",headers:llmHeaders(c),body:JSON.stringify(payload)});if(!r.ok){const t=await r.text().catch(()=>"(no body)");throw new Error(`LLM_HTTP_${r.status}:${t.slice(0,600)}`)};const data=await r.json().catch(()=>null);if(!data)throw new Error("LLM_BAD_JSON");return String(c.fmt==="openai"?(data?.choices?.[0]?.message?.content??""):(data?.text??data?.output??"")).trim()};const setState=(t,cls)=>setP($("statePill"),t,cls||"");const setARM=(on)=>{S.armed=!!on;setP($("armPill"),`ARM:${S.armed?"ON":"OFF"}`,S.armed?"ok":"warn")};const setLLM=(on)=>setP($("llmPill"),`LLM:${on?"ON":"OF